$X=\frac12\frac{d\gamma}{ds}$, then
\begin{equation}
\frac{dR(\gamma(s),s)}{ds}=R_t(\gamma(s),s)
+\left\langle\frac{d\gamma}{ds},\nabla R\right\rangle
\geq-\frac12R\left\langle\frac{d\gamma}{ds},\frac{d\gamma}{ds}\right\rangle.
\end{equation}
